1677:    * <p>
1678:    * This can be used to simulate a try/finally synchronous construct.
1679:    * It is typically used to close some resource after an asynchronous operation.
1680:    *
1681:    * <pre class="java">{@code
1682:    * import org.junit.Assert;
1683:    * import ratpack.exec.Promise;
1684:    * import ratpack.test.exec.ExecHarness;
1685:    *
1686:    * public class Example {
