178:      * <p>
179:      * The value is a regular expression to test the current request path against for a match.
180:      * If matched, the key is the name to use when recording the metric.  Please note that request
181:      * paths do not start with a <code>/</code>
182:      * <p>
183:      * As soon as a match is made against a regular expression no further matches are attempted.
184:      * <p>
